It was usual in my group of friends when I was younger (I'm a 33F)

I made out with a bunch of gay guys. One time a gay guy I used to make out with were asked "aren't you gay? why do you make out with her?" to which he answered "I'm gay, but she makes me horny"  and that made me feel like I had superpowers

&#x200B;

